---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import site from "../content/site.json";
---

<BaseLayout title={`Privacy | ${site.brand.name}`} description="Tau Ceti Labs privacy notes for the company website and update signup.">
  <SiteHeader current="privacy" />
  <main class="page-main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy notes for the company site.</h1>
    </section>
    <section class="text-section">
      <h2>Static website</h2>
      <p>The Tau Ceti Labs website is a static company hub hosted on Azure Static Web Apps. Basic server logs may be retained by the hosting provider for security and operations.</p>
      <h2>Optional analytics</h2>
      <p>If you allow analytics, the site loads Google Analytics 4 to measure page views and deliberately named interactions such as project, Discord, press-kit, and update-form actions. Advertising storage and personalization remain disabled, and form names, email addresses, and message text are not sent to analytics.</p>
      <p>Your choice is stored in this browser. <button class="analytics-reset" type="button" data-analytics-reset>Change analytics choice</button></p>
      <h2>Updates</h2>
      <p>If you submit the company update form, your email and optional name/interest are stored in Azure Table Storage and may be synced to a configured SendGrid Tau Ceti Labs updates list.</p>
      <p>Consent on this site is for Tau Ceti Labs general studio updates only. It is not consent for LithoBreak development updates or RaceCards premium launch updates unless those product-specific forms are submitted separately.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, contact <a href={`mailto:${site.brand.contactEmail}`}>{site.brand.contactEmail}</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
